#. ~ Description for field combat exoskeleton
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The final iteration of military power armor before the fall of civilization,"
" this type - a powered exoskeleton with high-tech segmented plating - was "
"designed for actual widespread combat use and was seen on the front lines "
"during the last days of the cataclysm.  Like the heavier suits, it is "
"resistant to most modern weaponry, but it is light and maneuverable, and can"
" fit into normal vehicles and doorways without fuss, a huge advantage over "
"predecessors.  Unfortunately, the world ended before it could roll out in "
"significant numbers.  There is an integrated chemical resistant bodyglove "
"that precludes wearing other clothing.  The armor is outfitted with a "
"variety of clips & clamps, allowing it to hold a few mags & grenades, as "
"well as a large rifle"
msgstr ""

